      "writtenOn": "2024-03-11T12:26:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This MM change must be tied to the pvmfw change (i.e. `llpvm_changes`) and inclusion of the `SecretkeeperProtection` capability in its kernel image. Otherwise, this CL will re-introduce b/217376291 for some configurations.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 113,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 113,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "e7bd85d00674fce13f41472b15a9d4ad2e016889",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "18e8db10_0266e2bb",
        "filename": "microdroid_manager/src/vm_secret.rs",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 113,
      "author": {
        "id": 1897307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-11T15:20:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The capability  `SecretkeeperProtection capability` is compiled conditional to `llpvm_changes`, see [1].\n\nAlso, the change is conditional on `should_defer_rollback_protection` [See L94] which ties it to pvmfw changes as well. I believe we have all configurations covered from attacks described in b/217376291, please let me know if you find a corner case that is not covered.\n\n[1] https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/microdroid/Android.bp;l\u003d507-517?q\u003d%22secretkeeper_protection%22",
      "parentUuid": "2b27d32d_6a29567f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 113,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 113,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "e7bd85d00674fce13f41472b15a9d4ad2e016889",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
