        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-11T12:26:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit, DRY `cfg!(llpvm_changes)` and `salt_from_instance_id`:\n```\nif cfg!(llpvm_changes) {\n    let salt \u003d salt_from_instance_id(fdt)?;\n    \n    if should_defer_...(fdt)? \u0026\u0026 verified_boot_data.has_capability(...) {\n        // ...\n        (false, salt)\n    } else {\n        // ...\n        (new_instance, salt)\n    }\n} else {\n    get_or_generate_instance_salt(...)?\n}\n```",
      "range": {
